  era: "c. 7000 BCE \xB7 Section 1 \xB7 Prehistoric India \xB7 c. 1.5 million years ago \u2013 700 BCE"
  title: Neolithic Age
  text: The Neolithic, or New Stone Age, brought farming, herding, polished stone tools and village life. In the north-west it began early, at Mehrgarh around 7000 BCE. In other parts of India it appeared later, at different times in different regions.
